<title>USA: FGIC qualifies six muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies six muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance the following six municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Redding School District, Calif., $7.215 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Lafayette, La., $26 million public improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--Campbell-Savona Community School District, N.Y. $3.9 million GOs</p>
<p>--Milton Area School District, Pa., $9.995 million GOs</p>
<p>--Brownsville, Texas, $5.01 million tax and revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Brownsville, Texas, $2.185 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
